e, unlike the last ones, there is a lot of keys and features to learn.\n\nOnce you get comfortable with playing the game, I'd highly recommend joining a Milsim Unit, if that's what you're into of course, if not, join some KoTH servers or Invade & Annex.\n\n9/10\n\nEDIT: Did this for a medal, woop, still a lot of hours, yikes.\n\nEDIT EDIT: another medal, pog\n\nEDIT EDIT EDIT: lmao antoher one", "timestamp_created": 1486504184, "timestamp_updated": 1733035205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497159093618392944", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29769882", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083397211", "personaname": "Milky", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/funnymemeindividual64/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 253073, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 35516, "last_played": 1789853466, "avatar": "b246ca4f1d0538f1b2b5c175aea49a208de57ea3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Created a Jihadi terrorist squad and stormed the AO without a second thought.", "timestamp_created": 1486503084, "timestamp_updated": 1486503084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519608736038208008", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29768549", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082479935", "personaname": "brettjournal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082479935/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 24217, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review